  "content": "\n\n<p>如需本模组的数据包版本，请前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarmers-cutting-nethers-exoticism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p>\n<p>为<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Exoticism</a>添加了更多<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>的砧板切割配方。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持所有木材类型的树皮采集、剥皮与回收</li>\n<li>增加仙人掌果茎（Pitaya Stems）的染料产出</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/nethers_exoticism/media/woodcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"木材切割\"><br><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/nethers_exoticism/media/pitayastemcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"花卉切割\"></p>\n<p>想要将 Farmer's Cutting 的所有内容整合为一个模组？请查看&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-cutting-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Cutting Collection</a>！</p>",
